WEBVTT

00:06.040 --> 00:08.380
<b>I like walking around Shibuya at night.</b>

00:13.130 --> 00:17.130
<b>Jellyfish are not capable of swimming on their own.</b>

00:18.040 --> 00:25.380
<b>When I'm in a town where no one recognizes me,
drifting around as aimlessly as a jellyfish,</b>

00:27.380 --> 00:31.290
<b>I don't have to worry about who might be watching.</b>

00:32.790 --> 00:37.040
<b>They simply drift, going along with the flow of the water.</b>

00:37.710 --> 00:40.380
<b>When I walk surrounded by colorful neon lights,</b>

00:41.290 --> 00:43.920
<b>I feel as if I'm shining, too.</b>

00:42.330 --> 00:45.130
<b>560,000 yen?! Yikes!</b>

00:45.960 --> 00:48.960
<b>They may seem like fragile creatures,</b>

00:49.210 --> 00:52.330
<b>but they actually have quite an incredible trait.</b>

00:53.330 --> 00:54.330
<b>And that trait is...</b>

00:54.330 --> 00:55.330
<b>Whoa!</b>

01:01.420 --> 01:04.920
<b>Hey Sis? You're gonna be late to school!</b>

01:08.000 --> 01:12.670
<b>My name is Mahiru Kouzuki, age 17,
living in Omiya Ward of Saitama City-</b>

01:12.670 --> 01:15.040
<b>Kaho, that's not okay. Delete it.</b>

01:15.380 --> 01:16.460
<b>Aw, what?</b>

01:16.460 --> 01:20.790
<b>But sleeping faces of actual high school girls
is the most coveted content in the world!</b>

01:21.080 --> 01:22.460
<b>This'll go viral for sure!</b>

01:23.460 --> 01:25.710
<b>Elementary school kids shouldn't
be talking about going viral!</b>

01:26.290 --> 01:30.170
<b>Besides, ordinary high school girls
on PikPok are a dime a dozen.</b>

01:30.540 --> 01:33.080
<b>I don't even have makeup on. No one wants that.</b>

01:33.080 --> 01:33.830
<b>Hey!</b>

01:34.130 --> 01:35.460
<b>That's power abuse!</b>

01:35.460 --> 01:36.790
<b>How, may I ask?</b>

01:37.080 --> 01:38.960
<b>Why don't you get going to school?</b>

01:38.960 --> 01:40.830
<b>You don't get it, do you?</b>

01:40.830 --> 01:45.210
<b>These days, going viral makes much
more money than going to school.</b>

01:45.330 --> 01:47.500
<b>That's right, I'm gonna be an influencer!</b>

01:46.920 --> 01:47.960
<b>Kaho.</b>

01:48.460 --> 01:52.210
<b>Better not post photos of you goofing off in the display
fridge at your part-time job when you grow up.</b>

01:52.500 --> 01:53.080
<b>Huh?</b>

01:54.080 --> 01:56.170
<b>got in the fridge lol</b>

01:54.080 --> 01:56.170
<b>on the job lmao</b>

01:54.080 --> 01:56.170
<b>Rampant Pranking on the Job</b>

01:54.090 --> 01:55.420
<b>"Pranking on the job"?</b>

01:56.500 --> 01:58.880
<b>You can't cause trouble for other people, you hear?</b>

01:59.170 --> 02:00.880
<b>I'm not that immature.</b>

02:01.250 --> 02:04.460
<b>Ooh. But look at you.</b>

02:05.290 --> 02:07.250
<b>You're actually pretty childish yourself.</b>

02:07.250 --> 02:11.080
<b>Hey! What does it matter?! No one's gonna see them!</b>

02:11.080 --> 02:13.750
<b>Meanwhile, you always go for clothing
and makeup that don't stand out.</b>

02:13.750 --> 02:19.330
<b>Um, hello? This lipstick was featured by Yukochi,
who has like 300k followers, okay?</b>

02:19.330 --> 02:20.960
<b>It's as cute as it gets!</b>

02:21.170 --> 02:27.830
<b>Nuh-uh. That only looks good on her 'cuz she's
fair-skinned with a tiny face and a nose like Cleopatra's!</b>

02:27.830 --> 02:28.960
<b>Cleopatra...</b>

02:29.630 --> 02:32.710
<b>But when some ordinary girl copies that look...</b>

02:32.880 --> 02:34.670
<b>Uh, what if she does?</b>

02:35.040 --> 02:36.750
<b>What, what, what, what, what?</b>

02:39.000 --> 02:40.330
<b>She's just becomes run-of-the-mill.</b>

02:44.130 --> 02:46.710
<b>What?! But it's Halloween!</b>

02:46.920 --> 02:50.170
<b>I mean, we can go, but do we have to get
serious about the whole costume thing?</b>

02:50.170 --> 02:51.380
<b>I know, right?</b>

02:51.630 --> 02:57.630
<b>Well sure, but I wanna prove I'm worth
something before I die, you know?!</b>

02:57.830 --> 02:59.500
<b>Oh, I can kinda understand that.</b>

02:59.500 --> 03:00.290
<b>Right?!</b>

03:00.580 --> 03:03.830
<b>Halloween</b>

03:00.920 --> 03:04.250
<b>Entrance exams are looming ahead.
We don't have much time left!</b>

03:04.500 --> 03:06.920
<b>We've gotta transform into a new version of ourselves!</b>

03:07.210 --> 03:08.580
<b>We've got you covered there.</b>

03:08.580 --> 03:09.330
<b>Mahiru!</b>

03:10.960 --> 03:16.790
<b>We're high school girls</b>

03:10.960 --> 03:16.790
<b>Mahiru               Emi               Chiepi                   Saori</b>

03:11.540 --> 03:12.080
<b>Here.</b>

03:12.080 --> 03:14.330
<b>Look at us. New, improved, and cute!</b>

03:14.330 --> 03:16.790
<b>Thanks to illustrator extraordinaire, Mahiru.</b>

03:18.170 --> 03:19.420
<b>A gift from the Watase Atelier of Painting</b>

03:18.170 --> 03:19.420
<b>Original idea by Mahiru Kouzuki</b>

03:21.670 --> 03:24.170
<b>Hey, don't call me that!</b>

03:24.170 --> 03:26.380
<b>I gave up the whole drawing thing years ago.</b>

03:26.380 --> 03:27.500
<b>Oh, that's right.</b>

03:27.750 --> 03:32.330
<b>Us high school girls have to focus on
what's in front of us. And that's all we really want.</b>

03:32.330 --> 03:33.500
<b>Right, Mahiru?</b>

03:35.000 --> 03:36.630
<b>Yeah. Totally.</b>

03:38.540 --> 03:40.380
<b>But you don't actually think so.</b>

03:40.540 --> 03:43.460
<b>Well, that's why I needed to vent.</b>

03:44.290 --> 03:46.420
<b>That's pretty messy. You managing okay?</b>

03:47.040 --> 03:49.330
<b>As blunt as ever, I see.</b>

03:49.880 --> 03:50.710
<b>Well, yeah.</b>

03:51.170 --> 03:54.130
<b>That's why Nox Ryugasaki's so popular.</b>

03:55.330 --> 03:57.540
<b>Of course. You know what you're talking about, Kiui.</b>

03:57.920 --> 04:00.170
<b>No wonder you're Tatekita's student council president!</b>

04:01.880 --> 04:06.040
<b>But honestly, I was kind of
thinking the same thing as her.</b>

04:02.830 --> 04:04.170
<b>Are these for real?</b>

04:04.170 --> 04:06.040
<b>Who would wear these?</b>

04:06.380 --> 04:08.960
<b>Mero, see all your fans gathered outside?</b>

04:07.210 --> 04:10.170
<b>It's not that I just want to wear a flashy costume.</b>

04:08.960 --> 04:09.880
<b>I do!</b>

04:11.080 --> 04:16.710
<b>But I do get the feeling of wanting
to be someone other than yourself.</b>

04:17.000 --> 04:18.380
<b>Then you should've just said so.</b>

04:18.710 --> 04:20.420
<b>I can't, that's the problem!</b>

04:23.290 --> 04:26.000
<b>Getting shot down when
you're being honest is so cringey.</b>

04:27.630 --> 04:29.960
<b>You've always been a scaredy-cat, Mahiru.</b>

04:30.330 --> 04:33.960
<b>At this rate, I'll still be a nobody when I grow up!</b>

04:34.630 --> 04:35.710
<b>Kouzuki!</b>

04:35.880 --> 04:37.080
<b>Coming!</b>

04:37.750 --> 04:38.630
<b>Here you go!</b>

04:39.080 --> 04:41.000
<b>Ah, very thoughtful of you.</b>

04:41.380 --> 04:43.210
<b>Oh, not at all!</b>

04:45.500 --> 04:46.790
<b>I'm home...</b>

04:47.460 --> 04:48.130
<b>Sharp Lemon</b>

04:47.460 --> 04:48.130
<b>Alcohol</b>

04:50.460 --> 04:51.420
<b>Oh, yeah!</b>

04:51.670 --> 04:53.330
<b>The strong stuff sure hits the spot!</b>

04:52.460 --> 04:57.790
<b>I wanna quit!</b>

04:53.880 --> 04:55.880
<b>That's so specific it cracks me up.</b>

04:55.880 --> 04:57.710
<b>Don't wanna end up like that, y'know?</b>

04:58.460 --> 05:00.790
<b>Then what exactly do you want to be?</b>

05:01.250 --> 05:02.580
<b>Well...</b>

05:04.790 --> 05:06.170
<b>Nothing in particular.</b>

05:06.170 --> 05:07.080
<b>Nothing?!</b>

05:07.210 --> 05:12.330
<b>If anything, I want to be someone who knows what
she wants to be, or knows what she likes, I guess?</b>

05:13.250 --> 05:14.460
<b>That's a conundrum.</b>

05:15.080 --> 05:21.210
<b>I've got my streaming, song recording, and video editing.
There's tons of stuff I wanna do.</b>

05:27.330 --> 05:28.960
<b>Mahiru? Are you listening?</b>

05:29.210 --> 05:31.130
<b>Oh! Sorry, what were we talking about?</b>

05:29.750 --> 05:31.130
<b>Sold Out</b>

05:31.460 --> 05:33.210
<b>About what you want to be.</b>

05:33.540 --> 05:35.210
<b>You're special, Kiui.</b>

05:35.210 --> 05:40.580
<b>When you're just an ordinary high school girl like me,
you gotta wait to be chosen. You don't get to choose.</b>

05:42.130 --> 05:43.830
<b>Mom!</b>

05:43.830 --> 05:48.080
<b>Look at this! My painting got chosen to be a mural!</b>

05:52.670 --> 05:54.710
<b>Have you really given up on drawing?</b>

05:56.080 --> 05:59.380
<b>Yeah, I don't have a reason to.</b>

05:59.380 --> 06:01.670
<b>I just don't see the point.</b>

06:03.080 --> 06:05.630
<b>Do it for yourself or whatever. Doesn't matter.</b>

06:04.210 --> 06:06.460
<b>A gift from the Watase Atelier of Painting</b>

06:04.210 --> 06:06.460
<b>Original idea by</b>

06:06.630 --> 06:07.420
<b>Yeah...</b>

06:08.710 --> 06:12.000
<b>But see, jellyfish can't swim on their own.</b>

06:12.710 --> 06:14.210
<b>Don't lag behind!</b>

06:14.540 --> 06:16.630
<b>You're too fast, Mahiru!</b>

06:17.630 --> 06:19.210
<b>Come on, this way!</b>

06:22.250 --> 06:23.580
<b>Here, look at this!</b>

06:23.580 --> 06:25.170
<b>Uh, what's with the weird drawing?</b>

06:25.880 --> 06:26.420
<b>Huh?</b>

06:26.790 --> 06:29.250
<b>Jellyfish graffiti? The colors are so weird.</b>

06:29.250 --> 06:30.920
<b>Should we scribble over it?</b>

06:31.130 --> 06:32.920
<b>No, we'd get in trouble!</b>

06:33.330 --> 06:36.580
<b>It'll be fine! It's weird enough already.</b>

06:36.790 --> 06:37.960
<b>Right, Mahiru?</b>

06:40.210 --> 06:42.170
<b>Yeah, totally!</b>

06:42.170 --> 06:44.670
<b>It's super weird, isn't it?</b>

06:43.500 --> 06:49.130
<b>A gift from the Watase Atelier of Painting</b>

06:43.500 --> 06:49.130
<b>Original idea by Mahiru Kouzuki</b>

06:50.580 --> 06:51.290
<b>Mahiru?</b>

06:51.880 --> 06:54.830
<b>Sorry, Kiui. It's about time I hang up.</b>

06:55.290 --> 06:56.040
<b>Sure...</b>

07:00.500 --> 07:03.880
<b>Two for 300 yen</b>

07:02.960 --> 07:04.960
<b>These really aren't popular, are they?</b>

07:06.290 --> 07:07.670
<b>I'm on your side, though!</b>

07:11.330 --> 07:12.130
<b>Hmm?</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:25.330
<b>Miiko (17)</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:25.330
<b>Livestreaming now!</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:25.330
<b>Hey, everyone!</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:25.330
<b>Let's have a great time!</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:25.330
<b>Subscribe to my channel!</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:25.330
<b>Venue: Under the train  tacks across from</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:25.330
<b>MIYASHITA PARK mall, in front of jellyfish mural</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:25.330
<b>Special Live Gig!</b>

07:33.960 --> 07:36.790
<b>Stop it! Don't defile my drawing any more than that!</b>

07:37.210 --> 07:37.790
<b>Huh?</b>

07:40.130 --> 07:41.670
<b>Yeah, right.</b>

07:41.920 --> 07:44.040
<b>What kind of hot-blooded weirdo would do that?!</b>

07:44.040 --> 07:45.580
<b>Besides...</b>

07:45.750 --> 07:50.000
<b>A gift from the Watase Atelier of Painting</b>

07:45.750 --> 07:50.000
<b>Original idea by Mahiru Kouzuki</b>

07:46.500 --> 07:49.250
<b>It's not like I have any right to say that.</b>

07:50.130 --> 07:50.750
<b>Hey!</b>

07:51.210 --> 07:51.750
<b>Huh?</b>

07:54.630 --> 07:56.830
<b>Don't go defiling that mural I love!</b>

07:59.670 --> 08:02.210
<b>What, you mean this old scribble?</b>

08:02.210 --> 08:05.290
<b>It's not a scribble! It's a picture of jellyfish!</b>

08:05.420 --> 08:06.080
<b>This?</b>

08:06.710 --> 08:07.830
<b>Wait, aren't you...</b>

08:21.250 --> 08:24.500
<b>Oh, come on! Are you kidding?!
Why wouldja lose, Hamanoumi?!</b>

08:24.500 --> 08:25.630
<b>That's no good.</b>

08:31.080 --> 08:33.000
<b>Okay, what am I, a stalker?</b>

08:33.670 --> 08:34.290
<b>Still!</b>

08:41.330 --> 08:43.380
<b>Well, that's how these things go.</b>

08:43.790 --> 08:45.290
<b>I mean, what would I have-</b>

08:50.040 --> 08:52.250
<b>Hey. You keep following me.</b>

08:52.250 --> 08:54.210
<b>Are you a stalker? Or bent on doxing me?</b>

08:54.210 --> 08:55.540
<b>"D-doxing"?</b>

08:55.540 --> 08:59.290
<b>Uh, no! I mean, I can't deny
I was stalking you, pretty much.</b>

08:59.290 --> 09:00.790
<b>You said it yourself. Let's call the cops.</b>

09:00.790 --> 09:02.290
<b>No, no, that's not it!</b>

09:02.290 --> 09:06.920
<b>Um, earlier... you raised your voice at the live street gig.</b>

09:07.460 --> 09:08.960
<b>Sure I did. So?</b>

09:09.710 --> 09:11.130
<b>You said you liked that mural.</b>

09:11.130 --> 09:12.630
<b>Yeah, so what?</b>

09:12.630 --> 09:14.790
<b>Uh, you see...</b>

09:16.080 --> 09:18.250
<b>I'm the one who painted that!</b>

09:21.210 --> 09:22.330
<b>I-I have proof.</b>

09:22.630 --> 09:23.960
<b>Yoru Umitsuki                                 10/8/2017</b>

09:22.630 --> 09:23.960
<b>Painted a mural with a friend from painting class</b>

09:22.630 --> 09:23.960
<b>on a wall near Miyashita Park in Shibuya!</b>

09:22.630 --> 09:23.960
<b>It's based on a painting I made.</b>

09:22.630 --> 09:23.960
<b>#WataseAtelierOfPainting #ArtToThwartGraffitiInShibuya</b>

09:22.960 --> 09:25.330
<b>Here, this is my account.</b>

09:24.170 --> 09:25.750
<b> 9/25/2017</b>

09:24.170 --> 09:25.750
<b>Ever since hearing the aquarium curator talk about</b>

09:24.170 --> 09:25.750
<b>jellyfish when we went for a sketching session,</b>

09:24.170 --> 09:25.750
<b>I've been drawing jellyfish nonstop...</b>

09:24.170 --> 09:25.750
<b>#IkebukuroMoonshineAquarium #YoruUmitsuki</b>

09:25.750 --> 09:27.210
<b>Though I cringe when I think about it.</b>

09:28.250 --> 09:32.250
<b>But, yeah I know...
That's no excuse for me following you...</b>

09:32.250 --> 09:33.790
<b>I'm a HUGE fan!</b>

09:36.000 --> 09:36.960
<b>Huh?</b>

09:38.170 --> 09:39.380
<b>Here's your order!</b>

09:40.290 --> 09:42.630
<b>Y-you've liked my art from before?</b>

09:42.880 --> 09:47.380
<b>Yeah! Back in middle school, my dad
brought me to Shibuya for the first time.</b>

09:47.670 --> 09:49.380
<b>I saw that mural and it was love at first sight!</b>

09:49.500 --> 09:51.460
<b>L-love at first sight...</b>

09:53.250 --> 09:56.170
<b>So? Why were you following me?</b>

09:56.170 --> 09:57.920
<b>Uh, well...</b>

09:58.250 --> 09:59.080
<b>Yeah?</b>

09:59.630 --> 10:04.830
<b>You defended my mural so... ou.</b>

10:04.960 --> 10:05.630
<b>Huh?</b>

10:06.420 --> 10:08.880
<b>You defended my mural, so thank you!</b>

10:09.290 --> 10:10.920
<b>That's probably what I wanted to say.</b>

10:11.580 --> 10:13.460
<b>Uh, I think?</b>

10:15.080 --> 10:17.210
<b>Actually, never mind.</b>

10:17.920 --> 10:20.170
<b>This is coming out so painfully awkward.</b>

10:20.750 --> 10:22.540
<b>Glad to hear it, thanks!</b>

10:23.460 --> 10:25.080
<b>You're awfully sincere, Yoru.</b>

10:25.540 --> 10:27.040
<b>Huh? Yoru?</b>

10:27.040 --> 10:30.130
<b>Isn't that what you go by?
Or do you prefer your actual name?</b>

10:30.460 --> 10:33.630
<b>No. Sounds good. Call me Yoru.</b>

10:34.880 --> 10:37.710
<b>I'm Kano Yamanouchi, second year of high school.
It's great to meet you.</b>

10:41.330 --> 10:43.790
<b>She has such fair skin and a tiny face!</b>

10:44.130 --> 10:45.040
<b>As well as...</b>

10:46.130 --> 10:47.130
<b>Cleopatra.</b>

10:47.630 --> 10:48.250
<b>Huh?</b>

10:49.380 --> 10:50.460
<b>Kheyohatra?</b>

10:55.460 --> 10:56.750
<b>A former pop idol?!</b>

10:56.750 --> 10:59.290
<b>Yeah... That was a long time ago, though.</b>

11:00.130 --> 11:00.630
<b>Whoa!</b>

11:01.830 --> 11:02.580
<b>What?</b>

11:02.580 --> 11:03.710
<b>An "idol"?</b>

11:04.250 --> 11:05.130
<b>With a delinquent vibe?!</b>

11:05.380 --> 11:07.290
<b>Ow-ow-ow-ow!</b>

11:08.330 --> 11:10.710
<b>I made sure to look the part back in the day, okay?</b>

11:12.250 --> 11:14.790
<b>Black hair, pure and innocent,
giving my fans all the love...</b>

11:15.920 --> 11:17.290
<b>She's definitely got the face for it.</b>

11:18.210 --> 11:19.710
<b>So you're not doing that anymore?</b>

11:20.170 --> 11:22.040
<b>Well, stuff happened.</b>

11:22.330 --> 11:23.170
<b>"Stuff"?
Yo!</b>

11:23.380 --> 11:24.790
<b>Ohh, I see.</b>

11:23.500 --> 11:24.790
<b>Yo!</b>

11:26.790 --> 11:35.170
<b>Do not run on stairs</b>

11:27.210 --> 11:29.250
<b>Did you get in a store's display fridge or something?</b>

11:31.210 --> 11:33.630
<b>What? Why would you even think that?!</b>

11:33.630 --> 11:34.750
<b>Of course not.</b>

11:35.380 --> 11:38.710
<b>It's just, how do I put this? I kinda went up in flames.</b>

11:39.460 --> 11:42.630
<b>Flames? You mean online?</b>

11:42.880 --> 11:45.080
<b>Yeah. Something like that.</b>

11:45.920 --> 11:48.080
<b>Uh... Sorry.</b>

11:48.750 --> 11:50.330
<b>No problem. I'm used to it.</b>

11:50.630 --> 11:52.580
<b>The fridge thing wasn't actually super far off.</b>

11:54.710 --> 11:56.460
<b>But I think I can understand that a bit.</b>

11:56.790 --> 11:57.880
<b>What do you mean?</b>

11:58.250 --> 11:59.790
<b>The feeling of wanting to quit.</b>

12:00.380 --> 12:03.420
<b>It sucks when people around you talk about it, huh?</b>

12:03.420 --> 12:05.040
<b>Who said I quit?</b>

12:06.380 --> 12:08.250
<b>But you said "former pop idol."</b>

12:08.460 --> 12:09.420
<b>You haven't?</b>

12:09.790 --> 12:11.080
<b>Get your phone out.</b>

12:12.130 --> 12:14.000
<b>Try searching for "JELEE."</b>

12:14.540 --> 12:16.580
<b>J-E-L-E-E.</b>

12:18.830 --> 12:21.080
<b>Me singing a guitar arrangement</b>

12:18.830 --> 12:21.080
<b>of "Colorful Moonlight"!</b>

12:18.920 --> 12:20.880
<b>The anonymous singer, JELEE.</b>

12:21.210 --> 12:24.000
<b>I see. Like those "me singing" kind of videos?</b>

12:22.830 --> 12:24.080
<b>"Colorful Moonlight"</b>

12:22.830 --> 12:24.080
